import{_ as o,o as t,c as a,ao as i}from"./chunks/framework.DagBLaYp.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Optimisation algorithms","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"optimisation.md","filePath":"optimisation.md","lastUpdated":null}'),s={name:"optimisation.md"};function r(d,e,l,c,n,p){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="Optimisation-algorithms" tabindex="-1">Optimisation algorithms <a class="header-anchor" href="#Optimisation-algorithms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Optimisation algorithms {#Optimisation-algorithms}&quot;">​</a></h1><p><code>solve(EstimationProblem(model, experiments; bounds, loss), alg; parallel=EnsembleSerial())</code> accepts configured Metaheuristics algorithms or Optimization.jl optimisers as <code>alg</code>. The selection is resolved by named bounds; all other kinetic values are fixed.</p><p>For Metaheuristics, supply a configured <code>DE</code>, <code>PSO</code>, <code>SA</code> or <code>NSGA2</code>, with explicit options and reproducibility seed. NSGA2 returns a vector of <code>FitResult</code>s, one per Pareto candidate; explicitly choose a candidate before predictions. <code>parallel=EnsembleThreads()</code> evaluates each Metaheuristics population in parallel; for Optimization.jl algorithms it solves the experiments of each loss evaluation on threads instead. For Optimization.jl, pass for example <code>OptimizationOptimJL.LBFGS()</code> as <code>alg</code>: <code>solve(problem, LBFGS(); adtype = AutoForwardDiff(), maxiters = 100)</code>. <code>adtype</code> differentiates the loss and the remaining keywords go to the Optimization.jl <code>solve</code>. The objective is <code>loss(problem, selected_vector)</code> for advanced use.</p><p>Keep algorithm search options separate from forward <code>solve_options</code>. All native backend diagnostics remain available in <code>backend_result</code>. See <a href="./parameter-estimation">Parameter estimation</a> for the model workflow.</p>',4)])])}const f=o(s,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,f as default};
